{"type":"text","timestamp":1794560781517,"sessionID":"ses_e2bda6365ffe9SboL4EsHkThoV","part":{"id":"prt_1d42856f100166KCPT7ng28jIH","sessionID":"ses_e2bda6365ffe9SboL4EsHkThoV","messageID":"msg_1d42842c6001q27S03PR9U0yrI","type":"text","text":"T041 complete. Checkbox left unticked as instructed.\n\n## Prerequisites confirmed\n- **T013**: `rg -c \"COMMAND_POLICIES\"` over `lib/command-attach.ts` and `derive-command-bridges.cjs` returned no matches, and `derive-command-bridges.cjs --check | jq -r .status` printed `fresh`.\n- **T040**: `capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs` already carries `publishRow = row.split !== 'holdout'` gating `rows`, `attachedRows` and `typedRows`.\n\n## Files written\n| File | Change |\n|---|---|\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json` | Regenerated via `node $CAP --write`. Only `rows`, `attachedMetrics.attachedRows` and `attachedMetrics.typedRows` lost entries: exactly 44 rows removed, all holdout ids, 0 added. Non-published sections are byte-identical to HEAD apart from `capturedAtSha`, which the capture script writes itself (`99b68d8b3d` → `320e7b64d4`, the current HEAD). |\n| `specs/.../014-review-remediation/scratch/baseline-delta.txt` | Created by the pre-write projection diff. Empty. |\n\nThe temp capture file from `mktemp` was removed. No other path was touched, and `--write` writes only `OUTPUT_JSON` (confirmed at `capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:676`).\n\n## Verify output\n```\n== HOLD ==\n{\"holdout\":44,\"rows\":0,\"attachedRows\":0,\"typedRows\":0}\n\n== FLOOR ==\n{\"correct\":24,\"total\":44}\n{\"count\":0,\"total\":35}\n{\"own\":24,\"attached\":20,\"combined\":44,\"total\":44}\n{\"own\":8,\"attached\":15,\"combined\":23,\"total\":45}\n\n== rows published ==\n132\n\n== baseline-delta.txt ==\n0 bytes\n\n$ env -u AI_SESSION_CHILD npx vitest run tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts\n RUN  v4.1.12 /Users/.../.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  5 passed (5)\n```\n`HOLD` matches the required line exactly, `VX` reports 0 failed, `FLOOR` matches `$SP/before.txt` lines 4 to 7 exactly (equal, not worse), and `baseline-delta.txt` is empty.\n\n## Not done / caveats\n- Nothing blocked. The only non-holdout change in the regenerated baseline is the script's own `capturedAtSha` field, which is expected on any recapture and is outside the task's delta projection by design.\n\nThe operator's next step is to leave the box unticked for the coordinator to close, per the task instruction.","time":{"start":1794560775921,"end":1794560781517}}}
